<doc id="39777" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=39777" title="Uncal kasturi Himalaya">
Uncal kasturi Himalaya

Uncal Kasturi Himalaya atanapi Uncal Kasturi Beuteung Bodas (Moschus leucogaster) nyaéta hiji spésiés &lt;a href="uncal%20kasturi"&gt;uncal kasturi&lt;/a&gt;. Spésiés ieu bahuelana dianggep salaku sub-spésiés &lt;a href="uncal%20kastrui%20Alpen"&gt;uncal kastrui Alpen&lt;/a&gt;. Uncal Kasturi Himalaya hirup di &lt;a href="Apganistan"&gt;Apganistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tib%C3%A9t"&gt;Tibét&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Butan"&gt;Butan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nepal"&gt;Nepal&lt;/a&gt;, sarta di bagian kalér &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; kawas &lt;a href="Kashmir"&gt;Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="divisi%20Kumaon"&gt;Kumaon&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Sikkim"&gt;Sikkim&lt;/a&gt;. Uncal ieu hirup di lingkungan alpen luhur, kalawan tingkat kaluhuran anu panghandapna dina 2500 m luhureun beungeut laut.
