Henryk Mikołaj Górecki (6 December 1933—12 November 2010) was a &lt;a href="Poland"&gt;Polish&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="composer"&gt;composer&lt;/a&gt;. His most famous work was his Symphony No.3, the Symphony of Sorrowful Songs, written in 1992. More than one million recordings have been sold which makes it the most popular recording by a contemporary composer, getting to number 6 on the &lt;a href="Britain"&gt;British&lt;/a&gt; album charts.
