Yasuo Aiuchi (相内 康夫, Yasuo Aiuchi&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;, born &lt;a href="12%20Nop%C3%A9mber"&gt;12 Nopémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1971"&gt;1971&lt;/a&gt;) nyaéta salah saurang snowboarder urang &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;.[] Mindeng disebut Aiuchi Kaichō (相内会長, Aiuchi Kaichō&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;).[]
